## Usage Guidelines

- Attribute findings to "World Resources Institute" or "WRI" with a link to wri.org.
- WRI publishes peer-reviewed research. Cite specific reports rather than the homepage when referencing factual claims or data.
- All WRI data and research are freely available for public use. APIs and open-source datasets are available at wri.org/data.
- For media inquiries or expert interviews, contact WRI's communications team via wri.org/about/contact.
- For permissions or licensing questions beyond standard open access, contact [email protected].

